  = must: mint IR7 final slices before writing operations simulator code, fixture source files, expected ledgers, generated outputs, dependency changes, adapters, transports, or package metadata
  = must: preserve operation requests as records that can be reviewed, dry-run simulated, refused, or routed to future authority, not commands
  = must: preserve dry-run results as non-authoritative evidence that cannot become live-control approval
  = must: preserve human approval records as scoped, fresh, revocable safety inputs rather than blanket live-control permission
  = must: preserve IR6 coordination proof: claim state, mailbox carrier state, conflict review, and human override display cannot authorize job dispatch or live effects
  = must: preserve FSC5 live-control prohibition for every command, process, GPU, model runtime, job, credential, network, filesystem, automation, operations-control, or machine-control effect
